ERCTTT8B","text":"イタリアでは微妙なぼられかたをされた","ts":"1634803183.027700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["UEACRCY0Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QSOak"}]},{"client_msg_id":"639ebc9d-4b9d-4a7f-b0c7-b0e2d2c14b35","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"タクシーぼったくんないし、すぐ来るし、日本だとあんまり Uber の意味がない","ts":"1634803145.027000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UlF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6ac48af-04a3-463f-9ce5-29012ca66247","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、ナンバーだからそうか","ts":"1634791988.026100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Edp6S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89adae8b-c17c-4c98-b663-d07167954d74","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"白タクは営業認可を受けてない（白ナンバーの違法な）タクシーを指すらしいです\n個人タクシーでも認可を受けてるなら緑ナンバーになる（つまり白タクではない）らしい","ts":"1634791270.025800","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1634791334.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Vfu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20b43213-70e7-4829-b950-f39440e4f9b2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://dailyportalz.jp/kiji/walks-with-taxicab-driver\u003e\n\u0026gt; もともと個人タクシーの成り立ちがかなり前なんですけど、楢橋さん（※）という運輸大臣だった人がいたらしいんです。その人が個人タクシーの父とか言われているらしんですけど、その人の鶴の一声で。当時そのへんを走っているのは法人タクシーしかいなかったんですけど、それがとにかくビュンビュンとばしまくって危なかったと。その中から優秀な人達だけをチョイスして、個人タクシーを認可させてあげて。\n白タク=個人タクシー、であってるよね?","ts":"1634790999.023100","attachments":[{"fallback":"デイリーポータルZ: 「回送でも停まる」タクシーの運転手さんと街を歩く","id":1,"title":"「回送でも停まる」タクシーの運転手さんと街を歩く","title_link":"https://dailyportalz.jp/kiji/walks-with-taxicab-driver","text":"個人タクシーになる条件、目で止めようとするお客さん、F1のようなせめぎあいなど街を見る目が変わります (大北栄人)","image_url":"https://img.dailyportalz.jp/2716/1797/2572/top.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1618279200,"service_name":"デイリーポータルZ","service_icon":"https://img.dailyportalz.jp/6915/3957/6634/144.png","from_url":"https://dailyportalz.jp/kiji/walks-with-taxicab-driver","original_url":"https://dailyportalz.jp/kiji/walks-with-taxicab-driver"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HLAA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"188aeccd-0810-4088-96c7-997660671a10","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"旅客運送でかつ緑ナンバーの場合に必要という認識\nこれと白タク規制が合わさって二種免許で緑ナンバーじゃないと人を乗せて報酬を受け取れないという事になるのかな","ts":"1634790965.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LS5BV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a28a57c0-2916-4856-abab-e6bb52f41004","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ありそう。料金取って人乗せる場合に必要なんでしたっけ","ts":"1634790844.020400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0=oY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e394060-2d78-4d34-89c1-26de954baeaa","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"二種とかの兼ね合いもありそう","ts":"1634790771.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YTVaB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32ea4ff1-9397-443e-a742-823eb9273db6","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、タクシー運転手の技量を認めて白タク制度になったらしいので、わかる気はする","ts":"1634790691.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hPD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23E91D0E-FD06-459D-A03B-4187775DF14B","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ただ、日本だとライドシェアじゃなかったよね？","ts":"1634790636.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f0TJb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5527df8-e89e-4634-bb61-73216738a3cd","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あと引っ越しに使ったりとか","ts":"1634790427.017600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xBxa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a86ac841-4ea3-47be-bf89-39090858d736","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"Uber日本にいたときよくつかってました。出社するときに乗ったりとか","ts":"1634790410.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UZYZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"919AFFA0-6C72-4D4B-B9C1-356D3DBF050F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"いや、タクシー業界が白タク規制を頑張って、Uber タクシーは事実上参入できなかったんですよ。","ts":"1634790261.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WVz7H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b83b13b-d42b-48d9-8697-88fbf2c2f32c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"日本、路地的問題からカーシェアのほうがいまいちだったんかな","ts":"1634789899.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MIG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc0b40c9-0fd7-4b5b-8e38-ba57301c177d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ここ数ヶ月で急にこの用法がでてきた印象です。意味はタクシーではなく食事のデリバリーのUber Eatsのこと","ts":"1634789837.014100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ESBYI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77a1dcd8-2f92-4a7a-839c-d5cc6710ba55","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"最近だと日本語でウーバーというのがありますね","ts":"1634789801.013600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bciaY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e492d989-817d-4710-8f32-db4a19d52837","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"日本語だと主語が抜けがちなイメージ","ts":"1634785344.012400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z7nOc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85086a45-0705-4b50-a26a-eaa81d2b5fe9","type":"message","user":"U01BY3SDBRS","text":"大昔塾で「省略してある部分がないと普通そういう言い方にならないよね→暗黙の了解で自明なものとして省略のフレーズを補って考えましょう」と言われた記憶があります","ts":"1634785329.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"58Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3921f01-b864-46c5-87c6-19a6730edb6f","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"対応する表現とかは特に関係なく、あくまで「省略度合いとしては日本語もかなりのものじゃない？」という話です。","ts":"1634785027.008300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U01D44KSY9Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y7r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"227ca808-2cba-4dbb-8c53-f2c57ebb4639","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"wouldに「しただろう」みたいな意味があるから読み取れはするのかな","ts":"1634781516.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ug/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a9a50fa-3a67-4264-ae43-e823547fc6c8","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"「なら」に相当する表現がなさそう\n少なくとも知らないと読み取れないのでは","ts":"1634781461.004500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pFF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c399f1fb-d616-4772-a126-6b8669315e37","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"日本語の「（もし）私（があなたと同じ境遇）ならやるなあ」と同じぐらいの省略度合いなんですかね","ts":"1634781387.003300","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1634781422.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kM52"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5de93aea-1e81-4930-8d40-0b399b85aa59","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"`(If I were you, )I would do it` は難易度が高すぎる","ts":"1634780030.002700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i=El"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb736edb-a055-439d-9384-37b0f91f748b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ああ、いいのか","ts":"1634779241.001800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cmgT"}]},{"client_msg